0-02-2026\nReturning of Absentee/Mail Ballots\n09-23-2026\nNorman County Notice of Public Hearing\n08-27-2026\nNorman County Board of Commissioners\nNotice of Public Hearing\nThursday, September 17, 2026 at 10 am\nNotice is hereby given that a hearing will be held to discuss the Petition of Erik Pederson, to Use County Ditch No. 6 as an outlet for a tile drainage project, to drain property described as the East 80 acres of the Southeast 1/4 of Section 20, Bear Park Township, Norman County. Said property including roughly 80 acres, more or less, not assessed into said established ditch system.\nThe hearing shall be held on Thursday, September 17, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. in conjunction with the regularly scheduled County Board meeting in the Commissioners Room of the Norman County Courthouse, 16 East Third Ave, Ada.\nAll interested persons are invited to appear and be heard, at said time and place, on the said petition requesting to use County Ditch No. 6 as an outlet to drain property in Section 20, Bear Park Township.\nAmanda Riegert\nNorman County Auditor-Treasurer\nEvents\nview all events\nNorman County Courthouse\n16 - 3rd Avenue East\nAda, MN 56510\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 AM - 4:30 PM\nPopular Pages\nProperty Taxes\nPublic Health\nSocial Services\nTop Links\nPowered by\nrevize.\nLogin\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.normanmn.gov/\"\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nReddit\nClose\nundefined\nundefined\nundefined",
